WEBVTT

01:10.945 --> 01:12.197
Great hit.

01:13.239 --> 01:14.908
Ah, I did hit that pretty well.

01:17.994 --> 01:20.246
But I can't hit it far
with the driver anymore.

01:20.330 --> 01:23.291
What do you mean?
That was almost pro-golfer level!

01:24.584 --> 01:26.586
Wow, you're really something.

01:28.630 --> 01:29.881
That man, Shin Yeong-jun.

01:30.381 --> 01:32.550
How far do you think he is willing to go?

01:34.094 --> 01:37.931
I saw him go to this place,
so I went there twice more after that.

01:38.973 --> 01:42.060
YEONGSAN FUNERAL HOME

01:42.143 --> 01:44.145
-It's a funeral home.
-Right.

01:44.229 --> 01:46.397
It's been closed for about three years.

01:47.232 --> 01:50.485
But guess what I found when I went there.

01:52.612 --> 01:53.446
Buckle up.

02:15.009 --> 02:19.556
OUT OF BUSINESS
DO NOT ENTER

02:26.062 --> 02:28.231
An average family home

02:28.314 --> 02:31.651
consumes up to 2,000 kWh a month at most.

02:32.235 --> 02:33.820
But this place is abandoned,

02:35.029 --> 02:38.116
and it reads more than 5,000.
It's not even the end of the month yet!

02:38.908 --> 02:41.161
That means it's still using power.

02:41.244 --> 02:43.413
Right. And of all places,

02:45.331 --> 02:46.833
it's the mortuary.

02:51.880 --> 02:54.215
MORTUARY

02:54.299 --> 02:55.133
So?

02:56.009 --> 02:57.844
What do you think is in the mortuary?

02:59.929 --> 03:01.139
Son Myeong-o.

03:01.222 --> 03:04.309
It's very likely that Shin bought off
the caretaker of the facility.

03:05.018 --> 03:06.519
The property owner lives in LA,

03:06.603 --> 03:09.689
and the place has been on the market
for three years now.

03:09.772 --> 03:12.483
A lottery store owner
who lives nearby looks after it.

03:12.567 --> 03:14.152
Do you want to check it?

03:15.195 --> 03:16.112
The funeral home?

03:17.363 --> 03:18.698
Is there a way?

03:22.785 --> 03:23.620
First,

03:25.330 --> 03:27.749
let's put some food in your mouth.

03:28.791 --> 03:30.126
That's more important to me.

03:38.009 --> 03:39.010
It's delicious.

03:39.510 --> 03:40.511
Hey!

03:41.804 --> 03:44.724
You can't just come in here.
This is private property.

03:44.807 --> 03:48.603
We received permission from the owner.
I'm a real estate agent.

03:50.480 --> 03:52.899
Real estate agent? Why?

03:52.982 --> 03:55.652
What, didn't you get a call
from the owner?

03:55.735 --> 03:58.863
Looks like my phone calls
aren't the only ones you're ignoring.

03:58.947 --> 04:02.325
In any case, they're here to check out
the property. Open the gate now.

04:02.408 --> 04:04.285
We've already talked to the owner.

04:05.161 --> 04:07.497
What? Hold on a second.

04:08.039 --> 04:09.290
Let me make a phone call!

04:11.042 --> 04:12.293
Who are you calling?

04:13.086 --> 04:14.420
Mr. Shin Yeong-jun?

04:39.779 --> 04:42.448
This is what you've been looking after,
not the building.

04:42.532 --> 04:44.534
You only recently set up your store too.

04:44.617 --> 04:45.785
Pardon?

04:45.868 --> 04:49.914
Actually, until we met you,
we weren't sure if it really was Shin.

04:50.415 --> 04:52.500
But it really is him.

04:53.126 --> 04:54.961
Why did you test me like that?

04:56.713 --> 04:57.797
What will you do now?

04:57.880 --> 05:00.800
What do you mean?
Aren't you going to call the cops?

05:01.634 --> 05:02.510
No, we're not.

05:04.137 --> 05:05.305
You're not?

05:07.098 --> 05:07.932
Really?

05:09.600 --> 05:11.728
But why?

05:12.812 --> 05:14.647
Seeing how the body was vacuum-sealed,

05:14.731 --> 05:18.651
I think he tried to preserve evidence
by delaying the decaying process.

05:18.735 --> 05:19.819
Why do you think that is?

05:20.486 --> 05:22.822
Maybe it's Shin Yeong-jun's curling iron.

05:22.905 --> 05:25.158
While covering up Yeon-jin's mess,

05:25.241 --> 05:27.660
he might have developed
an ulterior motive.

05:28.244 --> 05:29.412
How sure are you?

05:29.495 --> 05:31.748
Shin could've made the mess himself.

05:32.248 --> 05:33.333
99%?

05:34.000 --> 05:37.003
If it had been his doing,
he wouldn't have left anything.

05:37.086 --> 05:39.005
There's no reason to keep the body.

05:39.088 --> 05:41.674
Then why are you leaving out 1%?

05:42.842 --> 05:43.843
I'm not sure.

05:45.261 --> 05:46.429
Divine intervention?

05:47.680 --> 05:49.515
Luck was never on my side.

05:52.852 --> 05:55.355
Then let me make up for the remaining 1%.

05:59.317 --> 06:01.319
I'll make it 100% for you.

06:02.945 --> 06:04.113
How?

06:04.197 --> 06:06.783
Can you make Park Yeon-jin
visit my hospital?

06:07.950 --> 06:09.952
Go ahead. What's this about Dong-eun?

06:10.036 --> 06:13.456
The married man
who bought this for me was your husband.

06:13.956 --> 06:16.793
Your husband was the one who told me
he plays Go with Dong-eun.

06:16.876 --> 06:18.669
Small fucking world, right?

06:20.838 --> 06:24.258
I heard some winters
are warmer than usual.

06:27.387 --> 06:29.847
And thick winter fogs occur
because of warm winters.

06:31.557 --> 06:36.145
So I'm just making it a bit colder for you
like how winters should be.

06:36.229 --> 06:37.480
Ms. Park Yeon-jin.

06:47.865 --> 06:51.577
So, have you looked into the guy
Dong-eun is seeing?

06:52.412 --> 06:53.246
Yes.

06:53.329 --> 06:56.249
He's a plastic surgeon
who recently opened a clinic in Semyeong.

06:56.332 --> 06:57.417
A surgeon?

06:58.418 --> 06:59.252
No way.

06:59.335 --> 07:02.755
He's really young,
and his clinic is full of patients.

07:03.256 --> 07:06.259
Don't get me started on his good looks.
He's so tall--

07:06.342 --> 07:07.176
Hey, lady!

07:08.344 --> 07:09.345
Sorry.

07:09.971 --> 07:11.722
His name is Joo Yeo-jeong.

07:12.432 --> 07:15.184
He comes from a wealthy family of doctors.

07:17.061 --> 07:18.062
"Joo Yeo-jeong"?

07:19.105 --> 07:20.273
Son Myeong-o?

07:20.857 --> 07:22.859
You said that name several times.

07:25.695 --> 07:26.696
It's that prick!

07:28.531 --> 07:30.032
What about his family?

07:30.533 --> 07:33.494
He's not connected
to Seoul Joo General Hospital, is he?

07:34.203 --> 07:35.288
How did you know?

07:35.371 --> 07:38.124
I heard that his family owns
Seoul Joo General Hospital.

07:41.502 --> 07:45.214
Starting this weekend, you'll see clouds
and rain all around the country.

07:45.298 --> 07:47.508
Due to low pressure in the north,

07:47.592 --> 07:49.469
rain will form above the west coast.

07:49.552 --> 07:52.263
It'll move to the central
and Jeolla region in the afternoon

07:52.346 --> 07:55.099
and move inland
toward the Western Gyeongsang region.

07:55.183 --> 07:57.810
The rain is likely to continue
until next week.

07:57.894 --> 08:00.980
Next Thursday is the winter solstice,

08:01.063 --> 08:04.484
which has the longest night
and the shortest day.

08:04.567 --> 08:07.820
In the old days, people believed
that a fair-weathered winter solstice

08:07.904 --> 08:10.281
led to diseases and deaths
in the following year.

08:12.366 --> 08:15.536
SEOUL JOO GENERAL HOSPITAL

08:46.692 --> 08:47.944
NEW MESSAGE
MISSED CALL

08:50.863 --> 08:52.281
You'd better reply,

08:52.365 --> 08:54.450
or you'll find yourself in trouble.

09:06.379 --> 09:08.130
Get ready, I'm practicing like crazy.

09:11.759 --> 09:13.010
-Bye.
-I'll see you around.

09:13.094 --> 09:13.928
HONG YEONG-AE

09:29.986 --> 09:31.153
Are you insane…

09:33.823 --> 09:35.491
Are you insane? You can't come here.

09:35.575 --> 09:38.160
Why are you ignoring my calls?
Why don't you text back?

09:38.828 --> 09:40.288
I asked you to come!

09:40.371 --> 09:42.832
I have to be here until 6:00,
or I'll get fired.

09:42.915 --> 09:46.252
Then you shouldn't get paid more by me
than what they're paying you.

09:46.335 --> 09:49.755
That money in your fake account
wasn't put there for no reason.

09:52.592 --> 09:54.176
I hear you, so calm down. Okay?

09:54.260 --> 09:55.720
How can I calm down?

09:55.803 --> 09:58.931
That madman's calling and texting
day and night. It's killing me!

09:59.515 --> 10:01.475
That's why I sent you Lee Seok-jae's info!

10:01.559 --> 10:03.144
What am I meant to do with that?

10:03.227 --> 10:05.938
You should've taken care of it yourself,
useless shit!

10:10.443 --> 10:11.444
You're out of line.

10:11.527 --> 10:12.528
Out of line?

10:13.738 --> 10:15.615
A petty civil servant sent his family

10:15.698 --> 10:18.326
to live in a house he bought
in New Zealand.

10:18.409 --> 10:19.493
How about that?

10:19.577 --> 10:22.079
You could barely afford
your mortgage payments,

10:22.163 --> 10:25.249
and now you have a motel
under your sister's name. How about that?

10:25.333 --> 10:27.168
That's not all!

10:28.502 --> 10:30.421
Your life was destined to be pathetic.

10:30.504 --> 10:33.591
I even matched you with "charms"
every month to protect you

10:33.674 --> 10:35.593
and turn your fortune around, and what?

10:36.594 --> 10:38.679
Are you trying to take credit
for my fortune?

10:38.763 --> 10:43.017
Take credit? You liked it
when you were reaping the benefits!

10:43.100 --> 10:44.185
Fucking hell!

10:47.647 --> 10:49.899
I'm getting tired of this, Yeong-ae.

10:51.233 --> 10:54.320
So that's what you think you have over me.

10:56.155 --> 10:59.700
After all, we're past the age
when we have friends.

11:00.201 --> 11:02.244
Maybe accomplices. Wouldn't you agree?

11:07.625 --> 11:08.542
Express delivery.

11:23.599 --> 11:24.475
What are these photos?

11:25.351 --> 11:26.769
School newsletter.

11:27.520 --> 11:30.481
I was debating who I should send it to,
you or Ha Do-yeong.

11:30.564 --> 11:32.066
I chose you.

11:32.149 --> 11:33.526
UNDER CONSTRUCTION

11:33.609 --> 11:35.027
Because you're Ye-sol's dad.

11:36.570 --> 11:38.823
So? What am I looking at?

11:39.407 --> 11:41.742
His name is Chu Jeong-ho. He's 39.

11:41.826 --> 11:44.829
He's a teacher at Semyeong elementary.
He takes pictures of kids.

11:44.912 --> 11:47.373
Ye-sol is also in one of those pictures.

12:05.224 --> 12:08.561
Move, motherfucker!
Move before I hit your shitty car!

12:08.644 --> 12:09.562
Fucking prick!

12:09.645 --> 12:11.397
Move, you son of a bitch!

12:11.480 --> 12:14.859
Who the fuck do you think you are,
you motherfucker?

12:15.484 --> 12:18.571
Fuck off. I'll fucking kill you,
you fucking son of a bitch.

12:22.032 --> 12:25.619
I can climb all the way to the top!

12:25.703 --> 12:29.123
I can hang upside down with no hands too.

12:29.206 --> 12:32.042
Really? Wow, how brave of you.

12:32.626 --> 12:35.045
Who wants to show me how good you are?

12:35.129 --> 12:36.505
Me!

12:42.094 --> 12:44.764
Seung-a, Ye-sol, Seung-wu, Min-ji.

12:45.264 --> 12:47.433
Your sitters are waiting.
What are you doing?

12:47.516 --> 12:49.393
Go wash your hands and get your bags.

12:49.977 --> 12:51.312
-Okay.
-Okay.

12:55.816 --> 12:56.734
Slowly.

13:06.327 --> 13:09.497
You're really good
at making me the weird guy, huh?

13:09.580 --> 13:11.999
I've finished what you asked me to do.

13:12.082 --> 13:14.502
Would you like me to print it out
or email it?

13:19.632 --> 13:23.177
What do you think is the fastest
and most sure-fire way

13:23.677 --> 13:25.513
of getting rid of Mr. Chu, Yeon-jin?

13:26.013 --> 13:27.515
It won't be pretty, I know.

13:28.015 --> 13:31.268
But I don't have time to waste
on a person like this.

13:31.352 --> 13:32.853
I don't think you'll get it…

13:35.731 --> 13:37.483
if I talk nicely.

13:37.566 --> 13:38.901
So I'll be direct.

13:39.527 --> 13:40.444
Please go ahead.

13:47.159 --> 13:47.993
I…

13:49.411 --> 13:52.081
hate unruly bitches.

13:54.375 --> 13:55.459
I respect your taste.

14:00.756 --> 14:02.174
I've had it with you.

14:05.761 --> 14:06.846
Follow me out.

14:10.349 --> 14:11.517
Who's Chu Jeong-ho?

14:15.271 --> 14:17.439
-May I help you?
-You can't.

14:19.066 --> 14:21.485
Just tell me where the son of a bitch is.

14:22.444 --> 14:24.864
That'd be me. Who are you?

14:30.828 --> 14:32.329
What's this about?

14:32.413 --> 14:33.998
Oh, it's you?

14:37.543 --> 14:38.502
Then this…

14:42.381 --> 14:43.716
must be the camera.

15:00.900 --> 15:02.651
Call the police!

15:04.486 --> 15:06.405
Who are you? Who the hell are--

15:06.488 --> 15:08.407
Shut your mouth and clench your teeth.

15:08.908 --> 15:10.993
If you don't, you might swallow them.

15:11.535 --> 15:14.288
Don't bother asking me for a settlement,
you fucking jerk!

15:17.583 --> 15:18.834
Hello, police?

15:20.794 --> 15:22.463
This is Semyeong Elementary.

15:22.546 --> 15:24.965
There's a fight going on. It's crazy!

15:29.929 --> 15:30.763
Here.

15:33.933 --> 15:36.602
It's what I put together
from last year's field trip.

15:37.686 --> 15:39.271
I thought it might help you.

15:42.358 --> 15:43.192
If…

15:44.777 --> 15:46.362
there's anything else in there,

15:47.279 --> 15:48.530
that was by accident.

15:49.615 --> 15:51.408
Please don't tell anyone else.

15:54.870 --> 15:56.705
Why are you helping me?

15:58.499 --> 16:00.751
It took me courage
just to get where I am now.

16:03.462 --> 16:05.714
I can't start a fight
with what's in there…

16:07.758 --> 16:09.593
but I have a feeling that you will.

16:21.563 --> 16:24.566
Wait!

16:24.650 --> 16:25.484
Hold on!

16:29.780 --> 16:31.448
-Stop! Please stop!
-You fucker.

16:36.328 --> 16:37.329
Wait.

17:07.526 --> 17:12.614
Ye-sol, stop crying and talk slowly.
I can't hear what you're saying.

17:13.615 --> 17:15.117
Uncle Jae-jun…

17:18.037 --> 17:19.788
came to the school and did what?

17:21.206 --> 17:22.791
Wow, this is pretty.

17:23.751 --> 17:25.335
Flowers always look good on you.

17:25.419 --> 17:26.920
Try it on.

17:28.881 --> 17:32.634
Let's go see the ocean
when the money comes in. Okay?

17:34.470 --> 17:38.223
I know from being on the receiving end
that blackmail works all the time.

17:38.307 --> 17:40.017
That bitch won't last long.

17:41.477 --> 17:42.478
Seok-jae.

17:43.145 --> 17:45.022
Let's just get on with our lives.

17:45.522 --> 17:47.107
This is too dangerous, you know?

17:47.191 --> 17:48.859
There you go again with your shit!

17:49.443 --> 17:51.862
Damn it! You're always so…

17:54.198 --> 17:56.033
I'll deal with you when we get home.

17:57.159 --> 17:59.912
I'm telling you this
because she's killed more than once.

18:01.622 --> 18:02.873
She's killed two people!

18:05.918 --> 18:06.752
Two?

18:11.298 --> 18:12.382
The Philippines!

18:13.509 --> 18:15.511
I heard it's amazing over there.

18:17.471 --> 18:18.972
Mangoes are super cheap there.

18:19.640 --> 18:22.392
I'll buy it for you tomorrow. Try it on!

18:32.861 --> 18:34.613
-Sir.
-What?

18:34.696 --> 18:38.367
That clothing shop,
where that guy got smacked in the head.

18:39.701 --> 18:41.036
Why bring that up now?

18:41.120 --> 18:46.291
Why wasn't that thing that was used
to smack that guy's head there?

18:50.754 --> 18:52.840
Who cares? We know nothing about it.

18:53.340 --> 18:54.675
You keep your mouth shut.

19:15.404 --> 19:17.406
I appreciate what you did last time.

19:34.047 --> 19:37.551
Seong-hee said
you're not going to use it yourself.

19:37.634 --> 19:38.719
That's right.

19:42.181 --> 19:44.850
Can you prepare it for me?

19:45.559 --> 19:47.144
I don't know how it works.

19:50.480 --> 19:53.775
Let me go! Why wouldn't you let me go?

19:53.859 --> 19:56.904
I told you it's legal in the Netherlands.
I'll never come back here!

19:56.987 --> 19:58.780
Come on, let me go!

19:59.364 --> 20:01.909
You said she's clean. Look at her.
What did you do?

20:02.409 --> 20:05.078
That brat is the devil's spawn.
What have you been doing?

20:05.162 --> 20:08.582
Honey, I think she needs to be admitted
to a rehab center--

20:09.208 --> 20:11.919
We might as well tell everyone
the pastor's kid is a junkie!

20:12.002 --> 20:14.338
That's why I said
I didn't want to leave Paris!

20:14.421 --> 20:15.714
-Why, you little…
-Damn it!

20:15.797 --> 20:17.507
You think we wanted to drag you back?

20:18.091 --> 20:19.760
Word was spreading among Koreans

20:19.843 --> 20:22.846
about you getting high every night
and sleeping rough!

20:22.930 --> 20:24.473
That's right, Sa-ra.

20:24.556 --> 20:27.643
The helper gives you IV injections here.
We can take care of you.

20:27.726 --> 20:30.437
You don't even speak English.
How will you live there?

20:30.520 --> 20:34.274
I get by with bad Korean grammar,
so why can't I live there?

20:34.358 --> 20:37.110
Let me go! I want to leave!

20:37.194 --> 20:38.278
Let me go!

20:38.362 --> 20:41.573
Dad, let me go!

20:42.074 --> 20:43.075
Damn it!

20:43.659 --> 20:46.328
Where are you going? Let me go!

20:48.080 --> 20:50.415
The victim is willing
to take a settlement.

20:50.499 --> 20:52.793
-I suggest you meet him--
-Who's the victim?

20:52.876 --> 20:54.586
That bastard is a criminal.

20:54.670 --> 20:58.173
He has hundreds of photos
of little girls in skirts. He's no victim.

20:58.257 --> 21:01.385
Just tell me if you're willing to settle
regarding the assault.

21:02.552 --> 21:04.596
The photos are a different matter.

21:05.847 --> 21:07.933
The law is so freaking strange.

21:08.016 --> 21:10.185
How is that different?
You should say something.

21:10.269 --> 21:11.645
You need to stop talking.

21:12.771 --> 21:14.856
You can talk to me.
We're willing to settle.

21:14.940 --> 21:16.942
Damn it, I don't want to settle.

21:17.025 --> 21:18.610
I want him behind bars!

21:22.364 --> 21:24.658
Uh, are you the man I spoke to
over the phone?

21:24.741 --> 21:26.076
Oh, yes.

21:26.159 --> 21:29.246
I'm Choi Won-seok
from Jaepyeong Construction's legal team.

21:30.455 --> 21:31.873
What the hell is this?

21:31.957 --> 21:33.208
This is the agreement

21:34.209 --> 21:36.628
we got from Chu Jeong-ho.

21:36.712 --> 21:37.796
Ah, thank you.

21:39.131 --> 21:42.134
Fuck, are you crazy? Are you mad?

21:43.719 --> 21:44.803
Shut the hell up.

21:46.054 --> 21:48.974
If you don't settle,
you'll be the one going to jail.

22:10.996 --> 22:12.831
I reached out to you because I figured

22:12.914 --> 22:15.208
it'd be easier for Jaepyeong
to reach a settlement.

22:15.292 --> 22:17.586
Right, and regarding the photos he took,

22:17.669 --> 22:21.173
we'll be pressing
both civil and criminal charges.

22:21.256 --> 22:22.674
Why would you get involved?

22:23.717 --> 22:25.135
If anything, I should do it.

22:26.094 --> 22:27.012
Don't you think?

22:29.598 --> 22:30.599
And who are you?

22:32.267 --> 22:33.268
Tell me.

22:34.603 --> 22:37.814
What right do you have
to press civil and criminal charges?

22:40.817 --> 22:41.860
So… you know.

22:43.070 --> 22:44.196
Don't you?

22:45.697 --> 22:47.115
That I'm Ye-sol's father.

22:50.577 --> 22:53.246
You're a much bigger asshole
than I thought you were.

22:54.623 --> 22:56.625
Do you have no shame at all?

22:57.667 --> 23:00.420
Jeez, you motherfucker.

23:02.422 --> 23:04.925
-Don't do this here!
-We're at a police station!

23:05.008 --> 23:06.718
-Okay!
-Please don't do this here.

23:08.512 --> 23:10.180
You goddamn…

23:29.574 --> 23:30.575
Damn it!

23:38.125 --> 23:39.376
That's enough now, stop!

23:39.459 --> 23:40.794
Mr. Ha!

23:41.461 --> 23:43.213
Hey, hold on. Let me go.

23:44.256 --> 23:45.257
Aw, shit!

23:47.134 --> 23:48.635
Don't hold me back!

23:48.718 --> 23:50.303
I'm not holding you back, man.

23:50.804 --> 23:53.014
I didn't let you off the hook
for your sake.

23:53.557 --> 23:55.434
It's simply not your place to meddle.

23:56.560 --> 23:57.561
So go.

23:58.353 --> 24:01.440
You've already been presumptuous enough.
Now shut up and get lost.

24:12.367 --> 24:13.368
Shit!

24:17.414 --> 24:18.790
The police?

24:18.874 --> 24:21.209
The police received a report?

24:21.293 --> 24:23.795
Yes, ma'am.
For illegal storage of a corpse.

24:23.879 --> 24:27.299
They want to search the mortuary
and the freezer. What should we do?

24:30.969 --> 24:32.220
Where are they now?

24:34.306 --> 24:38.059
We've already conducted an autopsy,
and the storage period is over.

24:38.143 --> 24:38.977
WINTER OF 2004

24:39.060 --> 24:41.313
The corpse will rot
if we leave it in here!

24:41.396 --> 24:43.231
You have to hold a funeral.

24:43.315 --> 24:45.817
EVERYTHING WILL BE OVER
IF WE HOLD THE FUNERAL

24:45.901 --> 24:48.069
IT'S UNFAIR, SO UNFAIR

24:48.904 --> 24:51.907
PLEASE, HELP ME

24:51.990 --> 24:54.576
PLEASE HELP MY POOR DAUGHTER, DOCTOR

24:54.659 --> 24:56.995
Doing this here won't get you anywhere!

24:57.662 --> 25:00.624
You do understand what I'm saying, right?

25:00.707 --> 25:02.083
AGREEMENT TO HOLD A FUNERAL

25:02.167 --> 25:04.920
Please review this and sign here.

25:05.003 --> 25:07.464
Or you can use your thumbprint!

25:11.718 --> 25:13.220
Please, ma'am!

25:15.430 --> 25:17.015
This is such a headache.

25:17.098 --> 25:20.769
We can't do anything with the body
without the family's consent.

25:20.852 --> 25:21.770
I'll say.

25:22.270 --> 25:24.773
It's only four degrees,
or zero at its coldest inside.

25:24.856 --> 25:28.610
I know. The body won't last six months
before it's completely decomposed.

25:28.693 --> 25:31.863
Think about all the smell
and the discharge from the decay.

25:31.947 --> 25:32.781
Right.

25:33.365 --> 25:35.951
So, we should move the body
to the freezer.

25:36.535 --> 25:37.369
Pardon?

25:38.036 --> 25:40.872
Oh, don't even joke about that, sir!

25:42.082 --> 25:44.584
She says it wasn't a suicide.

25:44.668 --> 25:47.921
The result of the investigation
isn't our concern.

25:48.004 --> 25:51.007
Also, we have no reason
to deal with the incurred losses.

25:51.841 --> 25:53.635
Well, it might get sorted out soon.

25:54.135 --> 25:55.971
They do say good triumphs over evil.

25:58.390 --> 26:01.226
Let's try to deal with it until then.

26:03.562 --> 26:05.772
I've been informed
there was a civil complaint.

26:07.190 --> 26:08.066
But

26:09.025 --> 26:11.403
no matter how much
I think about it, it's weird.

26:12.237 --> 26:15.490
Any inconvenience
would only have affected the staff.

26:15.574 --> 26:17.993
And no one would blow the whistle
after 18 years.

26:18.076 --> 26:19.160
Above all,

26:19.244 --> 26:22.706
why would they report this to the police
and not the district office

26:22.789 --> 26:24.874
or the Ministry of Health and Welfare?

26:28.461 --> 26:31.464
No clue. We're simply obligated
to investigate in a case like this.

26:32.090 --> 26:35.343
All I need is for the body
to be moved to the mortuary.

26:36.720 --> 26:38.972
I'm the complainant.
You know what that means?

26:40.724 --> 26:41.558
Yes, sir.

26:42.475 --> 26:46.730
Do you admit that you moved the body
to the freezer without consent?

26:46.813 --> 26:49.566
And the intentions behind that decision
are unclear as well.

26:49.649 --> 26:50.483
"Intentions"?

26:50.567 --> 26:53.236
You could've moved it
to conduct an illegal experiment

26:53.320 --> 26:55.071
or for any other dishonest reason.

26:55.947 --> 26:59.284
The body has to be
moved back to the mortuary.

27:01.244 --> 27:02.162
No.

27:02.245 --> 27:04.623
We'll take responsibility
for any unlawful acts.

27:05.206 --> 27:07.626
But the body stays.

27:10.337 --> 27:11.880
We haven't yet found the truth…

27:11.963 --> 27:12.797
YOON SO-HEE

27:13.256 --> 27:15.175
…behind her wrongful death, you know.

27:16.509 --> 27:17.927
That was our intention.

27:19.346 --> 27:20.597
Pretty clear, huh?

27:26.686 --> 27:28.355
Damn bastard.

27:28.855 --> 27:30.774
Either text me back

27:30.857 --> 27:32.859
or pick up the phone.

27:33.360 --> 27:36.196
So you're a doctor, big deal!

27:44.412 --> 27:47.332
Let me see here.

27:48.208 --> 27:49.834
COME MET ME, I HAS THINGS TO SAY

27:49.918 --> 27:52.587
YOU MUST IGNORED ME
BECAUSE YOU DON'T KNOW THIS NUMBER

27:52.671 --> 27:53.922
BUT I'M DONG-EUN'S MOM

27:54.005 --> 27:55.173
YOU HAS TO MET YOUR…

28:02.931 --> 28:04.766
Aw, come on!

28:08.019 --> 28:10.271
Damn it, where was I?

28:10.980 --> 28:13.817
YOU HAS TO MET YOUR FUTURE MOTHER-IN-LAW
HOW RUDE OF YOU

28:17.112 --> 28:18.947
I want pickles and…

28:19.531 --> 28:20.532
Check, please.

28:21.950 --> 28:26.621
-I'm paying for the person in the room.
-Bring me more!

28:26.705 --> 28:29.290
That fucking bitch! Goddamn it!

28:46.558 --> 28:47.809
What are you doing here?

28:49.227 --> 28:51.146
You didn't go to pick up Ye-sol?

28:51.896 --> 28:54.482
She's at her grandma's.
She got off school early.

28:54.983 --> 28:56.401
Mr. Ha is inside, ma'am.

29:04.367 --> 29:07.704
A temporary restraining order
on Mr. Jeon Jae-jun was just requested.

29:07.787 --> 29:09.456
We'll proceed as fast as we can.

29:10.290 --> 29:11.458
I see. Good work.

29:11.541 --> 29:13.793
I'm heading to a site now.
See you tomorrow.

29:13.877 --> 29:15.378
Why is Ye-sol at your mom's?

29:16.171 --> 29:18.089
There's a good reason. We'll talk later.

29:18.173 --> 29:19.924
How can I hear this from the driver…

29:21.050 --> 29:21.885
Your lips…

29:23.678 --> 29:24.804
Did you get in a fight?

29:24.888 --> 29:28.308
I can't talk to you nicely right now,
so let's talk later. Is that so hard?

29:28.391 --> 29:31.269
I can't even ask
why my daughter left school early?

29:32.270 --> 29:34.522
Are you trying to guilt-trip me or what?

29:35.648 --> 29:38.902
I'd rather you say mean things to me!
Let's have an argument.

29:41.196 --> 29:42.530
Fine. Let's talk, then.

29:43.865 --> 29:47.035
I'm not sure where to start,
but I think this is a good start.

29:49.162 --> 29:51.289
I'm mad
'cause the guy you're sleeping with

29:51.372 --> 29:53.708
went to my kid's school
acting like her father!

29:55.460 --> 29:56.294
Now argue back.

30:02.133 --> 30:03.968
You're curious whether I know or not.

30:05.470 --> 30:06.971
If Ye-sol's my daughter or not.

30:09.474 --> 30:12.310
Yes, I know everything.
Say something about that.

30:19.275 --> 30:21.945
You have no idea how hard it is
to hold myself back!

30:24.989 --> 30:29.285
Even now, your own personal safety
is the only thing you care about?

30:30.912 --> 30:32.747
Ye-sol is in so much pain right now…

30:35.583 --> 30:36.918
and you dare test me?

30:40.088 --> 30:40.922
At least…

30:42.841 --> 30:44.509
I tried to protect us.

30:45.593 --> 30:46.845
Even keeping secrets.

30:48.388 --> 30:50.890
And you destroyed everything
by laying it open.

30:50.974 --> 30:52.809
What did you end up protecting?

30:53.935 --> 30:56.521
Our relationship, your career,
even our daughter…

30:59.357 --> 31:01.025
You couldn't protect anything.

31:07.198 --> 31:08.867
Let me make this clear.

31:11.619 --> 31:13.037
Ye-sol will still be my daughter…

31:15.832 --> 31:17.250
even if we're not together.

31:40.523 --> 31:42.609
SEUNG-A'S MOM

31:44.402 --> 31:45.236
Hey, girl!

31:45.320 --> 31:47.155
Why aren't you texting back?

31:47.238 --> 31:49.574
What are your thoughts on the bribe issue?

31:49.657 --> 31:51.242
We're headed to the school now.

31:51.326 --> 31:52.994
We need you to cast a vote too.

31:53.077 --> 31:55.538
The school's a total mess right now!

31:55.622 --> 31:58.499
I heard one of the teachers got arrested.
What's going on?

31:58.583 --> 32:00.543
Oh, I'm so sorry.

32:01.044 --> 32:02.670
I'm still at work.

32:03.254 --> 32:04.839
Cast my vote for me.

32:06.507 --> 32:08.843
A bribe? That's insane.

32:09.844 --> 32:11.763
We ought to fire a teacher like that.

32:59.394 --> 33:02.063
FROM KIM SI-U'S MOM

33:15.493 --> 33:18.579
You should've called if you were coming.

33:18.663 --> 33:21.666
Leave these alone.
I haven't even removed the tags yet.

33:25.169 --> 33:26.004
Hey!

33:26.087 --> 33:27.088
Jeez!

33:30.925 --> 33:33.177
That was the last thing
you should've done.

33:33.761 --> 33:35.763
You can track me down

33:35.847 --> 33:38.182
and still be the shameless person
that you are,

33:38.683 --> 33:42.103
but how could you side with the bitch
that ruined your child's life?

33:44.605 --> 33:46.357
How could you abandon me again?

33:47.400 --> 33:49.819
How could you abandon me like this again?

33:50.611 --> 33:51.571
It was the one thing…

33:53.656 --> 33:56.492
that you never should've done,
even if it kills you!

33:57.076 --> 33:58.911
Do you know how much these are worth?

33:58.995 --> 34:00.580
These are expensive!

34:08.212 --> 34:09.213
Hey!

34:11.257 --> 34:12.091
Don't do it.

34:12.675 --> 34:13.509
Don't.

34:13.593 --> 34:15.261
Stop it!

34:19.474 --> 34:20.516
Hey,

34:20.600 --> 34:21.726
you crazy bitch!

35:43.391 --> 35:44.809
Hey, what was that for?

35:46.519 --> 35:47.520
Come on out.

35:48.229 --> 35:50.398
Let's have a parent-teacher meeting.

35:52.775 --> 35:54.735
Ha Do-yeong came to the police station.

35:56.404 --> 35:59.574
You said you only sent it to me.
Are you fucking two-timing me?

36:01.409 --> 36:02.827
I said, get out!

36:10.418 --> 36:11.544
Come on, then.

36:12.503 --> 36:13.504
Hit me!

36:14.213 --> 36:16.382
Hit me, you fucking loser!

36:28.269 --> 36:29.103
Are you okay?

36:33.816 --> 36:36.903
Man, I just recently got this car.

36:36.986 --> 36:39.322
I'm still getting used to driving it.
Are you okay?

36:42.200 --> 36:44.619
Is this son of a bitch crazy or what?

36:48.748 --> 36:49.749
Are you drunk?

36:49.832 --> 36:53.044
Why were you standing in front of a car
in the pouring rain?

36:53.127 --> 36:54.295
Dressed all in black.

36:55.129 --> 36:57.715
If it weren't for my nice car,
I could've hit you.

36:58.883 --> 37:02.428
Jeez, be careful from now on.
You don't want to die young.

37:03.054 --> 37:03.888
What?

37:04.472 --> 37:05.640
Fucking hell. Hey.

37:06.599 --> 37:07.934
You must be a fucking psycho.

37:08.976 --> 37:10.478
Here is my number.

37:12.813 --> 37:15.608
If you want to report me or ask for money,
use that number.

37:17.026 --> 37:18.361
I'm a bit busy right now!

37:25.117 --> 37:26.702
I'm gonna turn the car around!

37:28.079 --> 37:30.081
If you stand there,
I will hit you this time!

37:37.672 --> 37:39.423
Hey.

37:39.507 --> 37:40.591
Hey!

37:42.009 --> 37:43.177
Get out of the car.

37:43.803 --> 37:44.762
Get out, asshole!

37:52.353 --> 37:53.437
Hey.

37:54.605 --> 37:55.523
Hey.

37:56.107 --> 37:56.941
Hey!

38:00.778 --> 38:02.446
What the fuck is his problem?

38:09.578 --> 38:12.915
I'm giving my notice to vacate.
You have a week to leave.

38:14.792 --> 38:16.127
I hope today

38:17.795 --> 38:20.548
is the last time I ever see you.

38:21.632 --> 38:24.719
Stop giving me crap and leave.

38:26.220 --> 38:28.222
How many times do I have to tell you?

38:28.973 --> 38:32.560
Blood is thicker than water.

38:35.146 --> 38:37.732
I get one document from a county office,

38:37.815 --> 38:40.818
and it'll tell me exactly where you are.

38:46.907 --> 38:48.409
Go on and hide, then.

38:50.536 --> 38:53.873
Let's see if I can find you.

39:20.816 --> 39:21.817
I'm fine.

39:26.655 --> 39:28.074
So am I.

39:29.492 --> 39:31.577
What are you up to out there?

39:32.286 --> 39:33.162
You know, just…

39:35.456 --> 39:38.709
I'm just trying to show you that I'm here.

39:40.628 --> 39:41.712
Did it work?

39:49.804 --> 39:52.640
By the way, how did you find me there?

39:57.269 --> 39:59.939
Your mother reached out to me.

40:01.148 --> 40:03.317
Park Yeon-jin must have given her
my number.

40:08.823 --> 40:10.157
For your information,

40:10.991 --> 40:12.243
I plan on going to bed early

40:12.993 --> 40:15.579
and sleeping in very late.

40:18.791 --> 40:20.251
So make yourself comfortable.

40:23.254 --> 40:24.338
Good night.

40:30.344 --> 40:31.345
Good night.

40:59.290 --> 41:01.041
WHERE YOUR CLINIC?
I'LL COME TO YOU

41:01.125 --> 41:03.085
I WANT TO THANK YOU AND BUY YOU A MEAL

41:20.102 --> 41:23.522
SUNGHAN FAITH CHURCH

41:28.986 --> 41:30.488
-Hello.
-Welcome.

41:33.866 --> 41:36.869
It's a burner phone.
The photos are on it.

41:44.627 --> 41:46.128
Yes, ma'am. It's me.

41:46.795 --> 41:48.547
There's something you should know.

41:49.632 --> 41:53.469
Well, Moon Dong-eun
is at a church right now.

41:53.552 --> 41:54.386
Church?

41:55.471 --> 41:59.225
What, is she going to repent
and seek salvation all of a sudden?

41:59.308 --> 42:02.811
I'll say.
I wonder if God is home right now.

42:02.895 --> 42:03.979
Hey, lady!

42:05.147 --> 42:06.899
So, what's the big deal?

42:07.483 --> 42:10.819
Well, the church she went to

42:11.695 --> 42:15.449
is the one owned
by your friend Sa-ra's family.

42:23.916 --> 42:26.085
-Hello.
-Hello.

42:32.716 --> 42:35.344
I INVITE YOU TO THE GARDEN OF EDEN, SISTER

42:42.393 --> 42:44.228
Up and fight against the devil

42:44.311 --> 42:45.938
You whose sins are wash'd away

42:46.021 --> 42:49.984
Bold against the host of evil
Come and gather for the fray

42:50.067 --> 42:53.988
See the judgment coming closer
And perdition's awful day

42:54.071 --> 42:57.533
The Day is almost here

42:58.117 --> 42:59.201
Glory, glory…

42:59.285 --> 43:01.036
SHEEP HERD OF SUNGHAN FAITH CHURCH

43:01.120 --> 43:02.538
A SURPRISE SHOW AT THE UNDERGROUND CHAPEL

43:05.541 --> 43:09.086
YOU'RE ON CAMERA.
DON'T BE SHY AND SMILE, SA-RA!

43:09.169 --> 43:11.046
THANK YOU FOR FUNDING THE SHOW, SA-RA

43:11.130 --> 43:13.340
UNDER CONSTRUCTION

43:28.981 --> 43:32.568
Glory, glory, hallelujah

43:32.651 --> 43:36.322
Glory, glory, hallelujah

43:36.405 --> 43:39.867
Glory, glory, hallelujah

43:39.950 --> 43:43.954
For triumph drawing near

43:44.038 --> 43:46.707
YOU'RE ON CAMERA.
DON'T BE SHY AND SMILE, SA-RA!

43:46.790 --> 43:49.209
-Amen! Hallelujah!
-Amen! Hallelujah!

43:49.293 --> 43:50.878
Thank you!

43:50.961 --> 43:51.962
Amen.

44:37.591 --> 44:39.843
You're just a druggie
acting like an artist.

44:41.011 --> 44:42.054
Son Myeong-o?

44:43.597 --> 44:45.265
You damned devil.

44:52.940 --> 44:53.941
Go back inside.

44:55.442 --> 44:57.027
Crawl back into the wall!

45:11.834 --> 45:13.836
See? You know how to crawl.

45:14.420 --> 45:16.588
You were crawling just fine that day too.

45:18.257 --> 45:19.174
Think about it.

45:20.217 --> 45:23.220
Try to remember, Sa-ra,
how you crawled like a dog.

45:55.294 --> 45:56.211
I remember.

46:00.257 --> 46:01.759
I remember now.

47:20.504 --> 47:21.588
Was it you?

47:23.090 --> 47:23.924
Did you do this?

47:25.384 --> 47:26.927
I put a lot of effort into it.

47:27.427 --> 47:28.470
Do you like it?

47:31.598 --> 47:33.350
You're doing all this for nothing.

47:33.851 --> 47:36.144
Sa-ra's a first-time offender.
She'll be out in no time.

47:36.228 --> 47:37.521
You can't bring us down

47:38.730 --> 47:40.315
with something like this.

47:41.024 --> 47:41.859
Is that right?

47:42.693 --> 47:45.696
Then try with all your might
not to fall down,

47:46.572 --> 47:48.407
Weather Forecaster A.

47:53.954 --> 47:57.958
EXPOSING WEATHER FORECASTER A
FOR SCHOOL VIOLENCE

48:29.114 --> 48:31.241
COLLEAGUES GROUP CHAT
SAW THE SCHOOL VIOLENCE ARTICLE

48:31.325 --> 48:32.159
FORECASTER WHO?

48:32.242 --> 48:33.076
PROBABLY DRUGS

48:41.168 --> 48:42.836
What the hell have you…

48:44.171 --> 48:46.840
Sa-ra might get out soon, but you won't.

48:47.507 --> 48:49.927
You're a murderer
and not even a first offender.

48:54.348 --> 48:55.766
YEONGSAN FUNERAL HOME

49:07.361 --> 49:08.362
Do you have proof?

49:09.529 --> 49:10.489
Proof.

49:11.406 --> 49:12.366
Do you have it?

49:14.493 --> 49:15.994
You have no idea.

51:26.458 --> 51:31.463
Subtitle translation by: Daham Yoon
